#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2540
msgid "data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"DEADCREW_SECURITY\"]/text"
msgstr "The crew of the ship is destroyed, and you are cleaning its holds ..."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2545
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"DEADCREW_SECURITY\"]/choice/event/text"
msgstr "... Having done this, you rob the equipment warehouse nearby."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2602
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_M_TEXT\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"You decide to take a walk around the ship and enter the cockpit. It's empty "
"now, and the ship is flying on autopilot. Wonder where the pilot went? You "
"sit in the chair, disengage the autopilot, steer a bit, and re-engage it. "
"The ship returns to its original course. After walking around, you go to "
"your quarters."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2603
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_M_TEXT\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"You decide to do a tour of the ship. In one of the hidden smuggling rooms, "
"you find crates that weren't there before. After examining the cargo, you "
"realize there's nothing useful this time. Must check them more often."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2606
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_M_GOOD_TEXT\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You're lying on your bunk. Deciding you can't sleep, you go for a walk "
"around the ship. You enter the cockpit. It's empty, and the ship is on "
"autopilot. Where did the pilot go? You sit in the pilot's chair and stare "
"into the blackness of space. Suddenly, you realize you've been in this "
"sector a few years ago. You open the navigation panel and enter all the "
"beacons you can remember into the ship's computer."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2653
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_Mb_TEXT\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"You find Mal doing a tour of the ship. Together, you enter the cockpit. It's"
" empty, and the ship is on autopilot. Wonder where the pilot went? Mal sits "
"in the chair, disengages the autopilot, steers a bit, and re-engages it. The"
" ship returns to its course. Mal reports that the control system is in "
"order, and you leave the room."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2654
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_Mb_TEXT\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"You find Mal doing a tour of the ship. He says he's looking for some hidden "
"areas designed by the ship's engineers. Strange, what's he talking about?"

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2657
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_Mb_GOOD_TEXT\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You find Mal doing a tour of the ship. Together, you enter the cockpit. It's"
" empty, and the ship is on autopilot. Where did the pilot go? Mal sits in "
"the pilot's chair and stares into the blackness of space. Suddenly, he "
"realizes he was in this sector a few years ago. Mal opens the navigation "
"panel and enters all the beacons he can remember into the navigator."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2690
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_W_TEXT\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"You enter the cockpit. Wash is playing with little toy dinosaurs, mimicking "
"a bloody battle. He growls and snorts while clashing the toy creatures "
"together. Bewildered, you silently exit the cockpit, leaving the pilot and "
"trying to forget what you saw."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2691
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_W_TEXT\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"You find the pilot in the cargo hold, temporarily converted into a gym. Wash"
" is playing ball with other crew members. Seeing you and your questioning "
"look, Wash drops the ball and says with surprise, \"Oh gods, the spaceship "
"is flying at huge speed through space. Anything could happen! Who's flying "
"this thing?\" After a minute, Wash rushes to the cockpit."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2694
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_W_GOOD_TEXT\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You enter the cockpit and find Wash lying on the floor. He's tinkering with "
"the ship's control mechanism. A couple of minutes later, he reports that "
"he's fixed some equipment defects, and the ship has become more "
"maneuverable."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2733
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_Z_TEXT\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You find Zoe in the mess hall. She's peeling an apple with a combat knife. "
"You sit down next to her, take out your own knife, and take an apple too. As"
" you talk, you remember the old front-line days. Not noticing how time flew,"
" you stand up from the table and head to your quarters."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2736
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_Z_GOOD_TEXT\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You enter the cargo bay. Zoe is tinkering with the newly \"acquired\" cargo "
"crates, arranging them against the walls. After a while, she kicks one of "
"the crates into the center. Zoe explains that among the junk, there's "
"something valuable."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2773
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_I_TEXT\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You enter Inara's shuttle uninvited, discovering the airlock wasn't locked. "
"Inara is setting tea things on the table. She's clearly in a good mood and "
"invites you to sit. You start a conversation over a cup of tea. The next "
"thing you see is the ceiling of your quarters. Oh, those Companion tricks. "
"Next time, you should knock."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2776
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_I_GOOD_TEXT\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You knock on the airlock of Inara's shuttle. Getting permission to enter, "
"you tell Inara about the current status of your mission. Inara asks you to "
"leave her shuttle, but adds at the last moment that she has a client in this"
" sector, and he has made a prepayment."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2809
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_J_TEXT\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You find Jayne in the mess hall. He has laid out a pile of parts from "
"different guns all over the dining table and is polishing each one to a "
"shine. You decide not to distract him from this \"important\" task."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2812
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_J_GOOD_TEXT\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You meet Jayne in the corridor. He says he kept something from the last raid"
" in his stash. The client refused to pay for the goods, so now it's ours. "
"Jayne points to a weapon hidden in one of the lockers."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2845
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_K_TEXT\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You enter Kaylee's quarters after knocking and waiting for a \"Come in!\" "
"response. Kaylee is acting childish, making faces and dancing in front of "
"the mirror, dressed in a fluffy pink dress. You watch for a bit and then "
"leave."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2848
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_K_GOOD_TEXT\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"When you enter the engine room, Kaylee, covered in soot and holding a "
"wrench, greets you happily. She informs you that because of your cutting "
"corners on buying important ship parts, she secretly worked on the engine, "
"and now it's much more efficient."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2899
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_S_TEXT\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You enter the infirmary. Simon is conducting his usual inventory of medical "
"supplies. Noticing your wound after a recent skirmish, he invites you to sit"
" on the couch and puts on his gloves. After cleaning the wound and a few "
"stitches, he informs you that you'll be fine. You thank the doctor and head "
"to your quarters."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2902
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_S_GOOD_TEXT\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You enter the infirmary. Simon is working at the medical terminal. Seeing "
"you enter, he quickly stands up and goes for a medical gown, saying he'll "
"patch you up, while taking off his vest. You refuse medical help, explaining"
" that your wound after the last skirmish isn't significant. Simon "
"reluctantly puts down the gown and tools. Sitting back down at the terminal,"
" he reports that he managed to order modern medical equipment through his "
"channels."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2936
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_R_TEXT\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You find River in the infirmary. Hugging her knees, she rocks back and forth"
" and keeps repeating the same words: \"Two by two, hands of blue.\" You "
"leave her alone."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2939
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_R_GOOD_TEXT\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You search for River all over the ship, but she's nowhere to be found. Seems"
" like she's hiding again. After a long search, you hear her voice from "
"somewhere behind the internal hull plating. After convincing her to come out"
" from the maintenance tunnels, you discover she has a memory card in her "
"hands. After analyzing the data, you find the coordinates of a smuggler's "
"stash and enter them into the navigator."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2942
msgid "data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"RIVER_CACHE\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You arrive at the coordinates. It's a tiny rock with almost zero gravity. "
"After scanning the asteroid, you find an entrance to a small bunker under "
"the surface. Someone has hidden their loot inside."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2977
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_D_TEXT\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"You find the priest in his cabin. He's rereading the Bible again. You decide"
" not to distract him and leave."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2978
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_D_TEXT\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"You find the priest in his cabin. He is reciting a prayer aloud. You decide "
"not to distract him and leave."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2981
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_D_GOOD_TEXT\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You find the priest in the cockpit. He suggests using his old contacts to "
"escape the pursuit. Without thinking twice, you agree. The pastor calls a "
"nearby Federation cruiser over the intercom and gives it some instructions."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2986
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_TEXT\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"You are going to talk to a person, but he decided to take a nap while the "
"drive is charged.You don't want to wake him up."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2987
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_TEXT\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"You ask a person if he has any wishes for improving life on board.It seems "
"that everything suits him."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2989
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_TEXT\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"You are going to talk with a person, but he decided to visit the restroom "
"while the drive is charged.You decide not to interfere with him this time."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2990
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_TEXT\"]/text[4]"
msgstr ""
"You go to talk to a person, but he carefully avoids meeting you.He seems to "
"be ashamed of something ..."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2991
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_TEXT\"]/text[5]"
msgstr ""
"You go to talk to a person, but he refuses to talk, explaining this by the "
"fact that he has a lunch."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2992
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_TEXT\"]/text[6]"
msgstr ""
"You have enthusiastically discussing recent events with a person until a "
"signal of a charged FTL drive is heard."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2993
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_TEXT\"]/text[7]"
msgstr ""
"You go to talk to a person, but he smokes some incredibly smelly "
"mixture.Better another time ..."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2994
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_TEXT\"]/text[8]"
msgstr ""
"You are going to talk to a person.He all the time complains of his bruises, "
"bruises and abdominal pain.Perhaps it is worth improving the living "
"conditions on the ship."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2995
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_TEXT\"]/text[9]"
msgstr ""
"You find a person playing in some kind of space shooter.Giving him a couple "
"of tips, you go back."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2996
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_TEXT\"]/text[10]"
msgstr ""
"You find a person who plays on a glib of a melody from advertising.After "
"listening a little, you come back."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2998
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_TEXT\"]/text[11]"
msgstr ""
"The person says that on the previous ship he was a cleaner.He is satisfied "
"with the current work, and he copes with everything."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:2999
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_TEXT\"]/text[12]"
msgstr ""
"You go to talk to a person, but find him behind cleaning the keyboard on the"
" dashboard.Do not interfere with him."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3000
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_TEXT\"]/text[13]"
msgstr ""
"You find a person for something very obscene.He persistently asks you to "
"tell anyone about it, and you are embarrassed to leave ..."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3001
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_TEXT\"]/text[14]"
msgstr ""
"A person says that he misses his native planet very much, and recently he "
"dreamed of grass on the lawn in front of the house ..."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3003
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_TEXT\"]/text[15]"
msgstr ""
"A person tells you that he began to make huts on the lining of the ship in "
"the number of defeated ships."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3004
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_TEXT\"]/text[16]"
msgstr ""
"The person says that the devices for which he works would not hurt to "
"clean.He seems to hint at the rest of the ship's crew."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3005
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_TEXT\"]/text[17]"
msgstr ""
"The human tells you that after the last incident, he keeps a small "
"respirator in his pocket—\"just in case.\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3006
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_TEXT\"]/text[18]"
msgstr ""
"A person complains that he never found a restroom on this ship, and this "
"created him some difficulties in the last battle."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3009
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_HUMAN_GOOD_TEXT\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You go to the human and find him working with a pile of broken equipment. He"
" manages to assemble a few drone parts from old microchips."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3012
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_ORDER_HUMAN_GOOD_TEXT\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You go to the human and find him working with a pile of broken equipment. "
"Grinning, he shows you an Order weapon he just assembled!"

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3095
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_ENGI_TEXT\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"You approach the engineering, but he is busy setting up the system that he "
"controls.It is better not to distract him."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3096
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_ENGI_TEXT\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"You go to the engineering and find it in the process of scanning for "
"viruses.Yes, they also sometimes need prevention."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3098
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_ENGI_TEXT\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"You approach the engineering, but he is busy welding one of his limbs.It is "
"not clear whether the repair is or improvement, but it is better not to "
"distract it."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3099
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_ENGI_TEXT\"]/text[4]"
msgstr ""
"You approach the engineering, but he is passionate about the calculation of "
"the optimal path of FTL jumps.Having completed the analysis, he advises you "
"not to risk it."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3100
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_ENGI_TEXT\"]/text[5]"
msgstr ""
"You approach the engineering, but he is passionate about the calculation of "
"the optimal path of FTL jumps.Having completed the analysis, he advises you "
"to take a chance."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3101
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_ENGI_TEXT\"]/text[6]"
msgstr ""
"You go to the engineering and discover that he carefully examines the screen"
" filled with zeros and units.You do not understand anything about this, so "
"go back."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3102
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_ENGI_TEXT\"]/text[7]"
msgstr ""
"You approach the engineering, but he is connected to the internal electronic"
" system of the ship and does not respond to external stimuli."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3103
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_ENGI_TEXT\"]/text[8]"
msgstr ""
"You find engineering in the weapon compartment.He assures you that he has "
"corrected the guidance system, and now the guns will be more accurate to get"
" into the target."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3104
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_ENGI_TEXT\"]/text[9]"
msgstr ""
"You find engineers in the engine compartment.He claims to optimize some "
"chains, and now the engines give less waste to the surrounding space."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3105
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_ENGI_TEXT\"]/text[10]"
msgstr ""
"You go to the engineering, but there is no one in the compartment.Suddenly "
"standing nearby, the chair begins to transform, and the engine takes its "
"usual shape.Friendly frightened, you ask him to do this anymore."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3107
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_ENGI_TEXT\"]/text[11]"
msgstr ""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3108
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_ENGI_TEXT\"]/text[12]"
msgstr ""
"You go to the engine compartment and find him watching the video archive of "
"the last battles.He gives you a couple of recommendations, and you go back."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3109
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_ENGI_TEXT\"]/text[13]"
msgstr ""
"INSIS asks you a series of standard questions from your internal catalog to "
"communicate with humanoids.You answer them, and, apparently, this can be "
"considered a conversation."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3111
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_ENGI_TEXT\"]/text[14]"
msgstr ""
"Yegers reports to you: \"01001000 01101001 001011100 00100000 01100011 "
"01100001 01110000 011110100 00101110\".You pretend that you understand "
"everything, and go back."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3112
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_ENGI_TEXT\"]/text[15]"
msgstr ""
"Yegs reports that he updated the video card on his monitor.It is unlikely "
"that this will help in saving the federation, but also good news."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3115
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_ENGI_GOOD_TEXT\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"The Engi is busy inspecting the ship's hull damage. After some time, he "
"manages to patch it up a little."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3156
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_MORPH_TEXT\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"You approach the morfu, but he is busy setting up the system that he "
"controls.It is better not to distract him."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3157
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_MORPH_TEXT\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"You go to the morph and find it during scanning for viruses.Yes, they also "
"sometimes need prevention."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3158
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_MORPH_TEXT\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"You approach Morf, but he is busy welding one of his limbs.It is not clear "
"whether the repair is or improvement, but it is better not to distract it."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3159
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_MORPH_TEXT\"]/text[4]"
msgstr ""
"You approach the Morf, but he is passionate about the calculation of the "
"optimal path of FTL jumps.Having completed the analysis, he advises you not "
"to risk it."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3160
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING2_MORPH_TEXT\"]/text[5]"
msgstr ""
"You approach the Morf, but he is passionate about the calculation of the "
"optimal path of FTL jumps.Having completed the analysis, he advises you to "
"take a chance."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:3161
msgid ""
