"Having reached the lighthouse, you find yourself on a huge shipyard.The "
"construction sites and construction drones fill the entire sector!The whole "
"system looks like a ship plunged into the construction of the ship, "
"neighboring planets and the Moon are ruthlessly excavated in the process of "
"resource extraction for the ship of giant sizes ..."

