"super-ship, but the financing of this project was discontinued, and all "
"developments were frozen.When the rebels learned about this, they certainly "
"wanted to get the space unit to fight the federation.A special advanced "
"artificial intelligence, gravitational engines are installed on this ship, "
"the principle of operation of which ... but by the way, you still do not "
"understand ... \""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:59027
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_3\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Agree.You are actually not strong in the principles of engines."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:59029
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_3\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"“So, the rebels promised us financing, protection against pirates, regular "
"food supply and necessary equipment.In return, we had to finish work on the "
"ship for them.Of course, we agreed.After all, now we could complete the "
"project, which we worked on for many years.Unfortunately or fortunately, we "
"did not have time to put unique Zoltan shields on him, since the rebels "
"rushed us very much and set the stiff deadlines for all work. ”"

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:59031
