#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:65570
msgid "data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"META_TRADER_TEXT1_FM\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Near the beacon, you find a small trade station. The owner contacts you: "
"\"Hello, my name is Henry Quan. I've been trading here recently. You can buy"
" something from me or even donate unwanted resources for the station's "
"development...\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:65573
msgid "data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"META_TRADER_TEXT2_FM\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Near the beacon, you find a small trade station. The owner contacts you: "
"\"Hi there, I'm Bethany Jones, just Bethany is fine. I bought this station "
"recently and now I trade all sorts of things here. Buy something! Or even "
"better, gift me resources for the development of my little station...\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:65576
msgid "data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"META_TRADER_TEXT3_FM\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Near the beacon, you find a small trade station. The station owner contacts "
"you: \"Good day, old Adam is ready for trade operations. Donations for the "
"development of my humble trading post are also welcome...\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:65579
msgid "data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"META_TRADER_TEXT4_FM\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Near the beacon, you find a small trade station. The owner contacts you: "
"\"Hello, friend! I am the trader Abe Isamu. Take a look at my goods. Besides"
" that, I could expand my inventory if you donate something for the "
"development of this little station...\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:65582
msgid "data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"META_TRADER_TEXT1\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Near the beacon, you find a familiar trade station. Henry contacts you: "
"\"Hello again! Buy something or donate your scrap - everything will be "
"useful for the station's development...\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:65585
msgid "data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"META_TRADER_TEXT2\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Near the beacon, you find a familiar trade station. Bethany contacts you: "
"\"Hi there, handsome! I've updated my stock, check it out! Hmm, where is "
"that promised gift for my super-station?..\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:65588
msgid "data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"META_TRADER_TEXT3\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Near the beacon, you find a familiar trade station. The owner reports: "
"\"Good day, old Adam is glad to see you again. And I am still accepting "
"donations to expand the business...\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:65591
msgid "data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"META_TRADER_TEXT4\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Near the beacon, you find a familiar trade station. Abe Isamu contacts you: "
"\"Hello, how are things? I brought in new equipment, care to take a look? "
"Also, I was recently offered to expand supplies, but that would require some"
" investment...\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:65594
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"META_TRADER_TEXT1_MAXLVL\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Near the beacon, you find the familiar trade station. Henry thanks you for "
"helping develop the station and invites you inside."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:65597
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"META_TRADER_TEXT2_MAXLVL\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Near the beacon, you find the familiar trade station. Bethany thanks you for"
" helping develop the station, blows air kisses, and invites you inside."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:65600
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"META_TRADER_TEXT3_MAXLVL\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Near the beacon, you find a familiar trading station. Abe Isamu thanks you "
"for your help in station development and invites you inside."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:65603
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"META_TRADER_TEXT4_MAXLVL\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Near the beacon, you find the familiar trade station. Abe Isamu thanks you "
"for helping develop the station and invites you inside."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:65606
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"META_TRADER_TEXT_KSTATI_LVL_1\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"...the selection isn't very rich yet, but perhaps these resources will be "
"of use to you.\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:65609
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"META_TRADER_TEXT_KSTATI_LVL_2\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"...by the way, a new section with weapons has appeared, and we've also "
"managed to lower prices for supplies and repairs.\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:65612
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"META_TRADER_TEXT_KSTATI_LVL_3\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"...by the way, a new section with drone schematics recently appeared at "
"this station.\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:65615
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"META_TRADER_TEXT_KSTATI_LVL_4\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"...by the way, a section with augmentations has become available, plus "
"drones on sale and a discount on all weapons.\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:65618
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"META_TRADER_TEXT_KSTATI_LVL_5\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"...by the way, we recently added mercenaries, and repairs have become "
"cheaper.\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:65621
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"META_TRADER_TEXT_KSTATI_LVL_6\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"...by the way, I now sell systems, and supplies and drone schematics have "
"become even cheaper, plus there are weapons on sale.\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:65624
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"META_TRADER_TEXT_KSTATI_LVL_7\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"...by the way, after the station's last upgrade, I am selling systems and "
"augmentations at a discount.\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:65627
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"META_TRADER_TEXT_KSTATI_LVL_8\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"...by the way, thanks to your donations, I can sell drone schematics and "
"weapons at a discount; also, take note of our cheap mercenaries and repairs "
"at lower prices.\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:65630
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"META_TRADER_TEXT_KSTATI_LVL_9\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"...by the way, systems at my station are now even cheaper. A few more "
"investments and I'll be able to provide more weapons, drones, and "
"augmentations on sale, as well as mystical weapons and fuel at wholesale "
"prices.\""

